# ==============================================================================
# NCM workspace — what belongs in version control
#
# This workspace is not one package. It is authored source, third-party tooling,
# downloaded runtimes, release snapshots and recovered game assets sharing a
# folder. The repo tracks ONLY what we wrote. Three reasons a path is excluded:
#
#   (B) binary/runtime we can re-download and that would bloat history
#   (L) third-party content we have no right to redistribute
#   (S) machine-local state that must never be shared (secrets, saves, caches)
#
# Secrets note: NCM keeps credentials in DPAPI under %LOCALAPPDATA%\NCM\secrets,
# OUTSIDE this workspace, and server.jsonc lives in an ignored path. Nothing in
# the tracked set has ever held a licence key, DB password or SSH key. Keep it
# that way: no server.jsonc, no *.pem, no *.env, ever.
# ==============================================================================

# --- Downloaded runtimes and vendored tooling (B) -----------------------------
tools/WolvenKit-8.20.0/
tools/WolvenKit.Console-8.20.0/
tools/downloads/
tools/open77/
open77-server-*.zip
open77-server-*.tar.gz

# --- Release snapshots and reference material (B, L) --------------------------
# staging/ holds extracted published releases; references/ holds third-party
# source read for research. Neither is an editing target (AGENTS.md).
#
# ANCHORED with a leading slash on purpose. Unanchored, `staging/` matches a
# directory of that name at ANY depth -- which silently swallowed tools/staging/,
# our own authored ops scripts (bootstrap, the KB-51 load-list guard, the config
# flag scripts) that OPS_STAGING.md tells you to run. Those are source.
/staging/
/references/

# --- Recovered / third-party game assets (L, B) -------------------------------
# The liveries project is 353 MB of textures, including a 112 MB zip that
# exceeds GitHub's hard per-file limit, and a stock-reference folder explicitly
# marked do-not-redistribute. We keep the AUTHORED parts (see un-ignores below)
# and back the artwork up separately -- it is NOT covered by this repo.
wolvenkit-projects/ncm_rb15_liveries/*
!wolvenkit-projects/ncm_rb15_liveries/source/
!wolvenkit-projects/ncm_rb15_liveries/tools/
!wolvenkit-projects/ncm_rb15_liveries/liveries/
!wolvenkit-projects/ncm_rb15_liveries/liveries-parked/
!wolvenkit-projects/ncm_rb15_liveries/*.yaml
!wolvenkit-projects/ncm_rb15_liveries/*.xl
!wolvenkit-projects/ncm_rb15_liveries/*.md

# Built payloads and packaged output of any WolvenKit project (B)
wolvenkit-projects/*/out/
wolvenkit-projects/*/packed/
*.archive
# ...except the shipped payload's own archive: ncm-localized/ is the working
# release and must stay complete and deployable straight out of a clone.
!ncm-localized/archive/pc/mod/*.archive

# --- Machine-local state and secrets (S) --------------------------------------
*.pem
*.key
*.env
server.jsonc
*.dpapi
.open77/
save-backups/
**/master-identity.json
**/*signing-key*

# --- Caches, crash dumps, editor noise (B) ------------------------------------
.uv-cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
Cyberpunk2077.exe-*.txt
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vs/
.idea/
